ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"c91e2b19fe2140ab9d119ca32c8e817dd189e34b73608c5e983320d162be5b73","event_uuid":"5f4dd1cd-c7b3-468c-a968-ff2eb37ab124","position":{"commit_sha":"3d35d4638170984c2d858520ef4680493ba5d27d","position":"1787027780644308001-5f4dd1cd-c7b3-468c-a968-ff2eb37ab124"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787027744891207001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5f4dd1cd-c7b3-468c-a968-ff2eb37ab124","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"90a5-6a33-5cda-4064"}],"description":"## Context\nThe narrow rich-emission operation exists after S2, but production still mutates a binding reached through `all_bindings()`. ADR 0099 also needs the realized recovery boundary and reversal rules. `apply_handlers.py` overlaps RP-04 S3 and must be rebased after that ticket lands.\n\n## Outcome\nRoute production rich-emission state through the authoritative facade, remove production mutation-through-query, and finalize ADR 0099 without changing output, storage, or tickets publication.\n\n## Plan\n1. Before implementation, confirm RP-04 S3 `talismanic-profitable-isopod` is closed and rebase on its landed `apply_handlers.py`; do not edit the RP-04 ticket.\n2. Replace only the rich-emission inner-dict mutation with the S2 facade operation. Preserve hashes, counters, missing-binding behavior, logs, and baseline effects.\n3. Add a production-code census/poison test that fails when binding mutation is reached through `all_bindings()`.\n4. Finalize ADR 0099 with tombstone authority, explicit-unretire reversal, pre-observation recovery, intentional delta, rollback, and the ban on broad tickets-branch staging.\n\n## Testing\nRun rich-reemit, apply-handler, recovery-boundary, and ADR index suites against the RP-04-integrated base.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] RP-04 S3 is closed and its landed `apply_handlers.py` is the implementation base.\n- [ ] Production rich-emission behavior uses the narrow facade operation and preserves existing hashes, counters, logs, and missing-binding outcomes.\n- [ ] No production code mutates a binding through `all_bindings()`.\n- [ ] Binding/event file bytes and selective publication remain unchanged outside the approved repair.\n- [ ] ADR 0099 records the realized repair, ordering, explicit reversal, rollback, and no-broad-staging decision.\n\n## Out of scope\nConfiguration/secrets changes remain owned by RP-04.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_handlers.py","reason":"Cut production rich-emission mutation to the narrow facade operation after RP-04 S3."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_rich_reemit_state.py","reason":"Production cutover compatibility and poison tests."},{"path":"docs/adr/0099-binding-store-internal-ownership.md","reason":"Finalize repair, ordering, reversal, rollback, and staging decisions."},{"path":"docs/adr/README.md","reason":"Keep ADR index current."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","90a5-6a33-5cda-4064"],["parent","486a-69ef-6370-48ff"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"486a-69ef-6370-48ff","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["rp02","binding-recovery","adr","tdd"],"ticket_id":"ef69-e27b-d02d-4eef","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-02 S3 T3 — Cut rich-emission writes to the facade and finalize ADR 0099","ve